      "text": "@_akhaliq The demo is what sells it: same LingBot 1.3B input, the official build hovering around 625ms a frame while the FastFrames path is down near 52ms and actually moves like a game. Interactive 480p at that latency, plus the 14B Wan2.1 distill, is a much more interesting release than",
